# Cloudflare Pages response headers for beakbrain.com.
#
# Added 2026-08-13 after the pre-launch panel review found the site serving only
# x-content-type-options and referrer-policy: no HSTS, no framing protection, no
# Permissions-Policy, and no cache policy of our own.
#
# Rules are additive and every matching block applies, so /* carries the security
# headers for the whole site and the path blocks below add caching on top.
#
# NOTE ON CACHE LIFETIMES: nothing on this site has a content-hashed filename, so
# no rule here may use `immutable`. A year-long immutable cache on /assets/hero.mp4
# would pin the old file on every returning visitor's machine with no way to bust
# it short of renaming. The app (beakbrain-app) does hash its filenames and does use
# immutable — see birding-app/scripts/pwa-patch.mjs.
#
# NOT SET HERE: Content-Security-Policy. It needs testing against the inline styles
# and scripts on these pages, the Google Maps iframe embeds on community.html, and
# Cloudflare's email-obfuscation script before it can ship without breaking the
# site. Tracked as a separate item in the app repo's CRITIQUE-ACTION-TRACKER.md.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()

# Fonts are self-hosted and effectively never change under the same filename.
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

# Images, video and the site CSS/JS. A week, so a correction still reaches people
# in reasonable time given these names are not hashed.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
